    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA unique opportunity to acquire a four bedroomed semi-detached residence with a one bedroomed bedsit, ideally located in a mature residential area.Countess Road is a highly sought after location within walking distance of all town amenities, including Killarney House and National Park, the town centre, St. Oliver's Primary School and Killarney Railway Station.The property includes a converted garage which has been transformed into a self contained one bedroomed bedsit with independent ground floor access. The main residence comprises a sitting room, dining room and kitchen, on the ground floor. The first floor features four bedrooms and two shower rooms.This property offers excellent potential as a family home or investment opportunity due to it's prime location and additional self contained accommodation.The property also boasts an independent detached store/home office in the rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround floor: - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.6 x 2.7\n\n\nSittingroom - 4.15 x 3.6\nStove\n\nDiningroom - 5 x 3.36\n\n\nKitchen/Diningroom - 3.4 x 2.1\nShaker maple kitchen\n\nFirst floor: - \n\n\nShower room 1 - 2.5 x 1.15\nshower, wc.\n\nShower room 2 - 2.5 x 1.1\nshower, wc.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.5 x 2.7\nWardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 3 x 3.7\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.3 x 4.38\nWardrobe\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.35 x 2.3\nWardrobe\n\nSelf contained apartment: - \n\n\n(Garage conversion) - \n\n\nKitchen - 2.4 x 2.55\n\n\nBedroom - 4 x 2.5\n\n\nToilet - 1.5 x .9\nwc.\n\nShower room - 1.4 x .8\nShower, whb.\n\nGym/office/store: - \n\n\n(Detached garden building) - \n\n\nRoom 1 - 4.5 x 3.2\n\n\nRoom 2 - 2.9 x 3.3\n\n\nShower room - 1.4 x 2.37\n\n\nArea: - \n\n\nHouse/Apt. 134 sq.m., (1,442 sq.ft.) - \n\n\nGym/office 27 sq.m., (290 sq.ft.) - \n\n\nTotal: 161sq.m., (290 sq.ft.) - \n\n\n"
      },
